When I played a bunch of healers, I'd normally go pacifist down to minetown,
with a view to the protection racket. As a level 1 healer with approx 12 HP, a
lot of things will kill you before you realise you're in trouble, so having
four !oEH in your bag isn't entirely helpful. I'd advise drinking most of them
straight off, and relying on praying, engraving and the old standby, running,
to get out of trouble.

But then, my healers were never massively successful, and this might be the
reason.

